effect.aqtweaks.homestead=Homestead
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.melee_efficiency=Melee Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.melee_efficiency.desc=Melee attacks cost 1 less stamina. Light attacks may be free.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.ranged_efficiency=Ranged Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.ranged_efficiency.desc=Bows cost 1 to draw and drain hold stamina more slowly. Thrown weapons use the same hold rules.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.shield_efficiency=Shield Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.shield_efficiency.desc=Raised shields drain stamina half as often.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.adrenaline=Adrenaline
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.adrenaline.desc=Taking damage while below 3 stamina restores you to 20. 20 second cooldown.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.expert_climber=Expert Climber
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.expert_climber.desc=Climbing, clinging, ledges, and grappling cost 1 less stamina.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cardio_master=Cardio Master
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cardio_master.desc=Jumping and sprinting cost 1 less stamina.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_expert=Mining Expert
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_expert.desc=Your pickaxes harvest as if they were diamond tier. Speed and durability still come from the tool.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.evasion=Evasion
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.evasion.desc=Spend dodge stamina to cancel a hit from a living attacker. 30 second cooldown.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.respite=Respite
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.respite.desc=Once per minute, a lethal hit leaves you standing with Regeneration II and defence for 5 seconds. Does not save you from the void.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.power_attack=Power Attack
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.power_attack.desc=A full stamina bar empowers medium and heavy melee hits for extra damage and extra stamina cost.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.armor_mastery=Armor Mastery
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.armor_mastery.desc=Reduces the weight of all worn armor pieces by 1 half-feather.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_efficiency=Mining Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_efficiency.desc=Reduces the stamina cost of all mining actions by 1 half-feather.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.precision_shot=Precision Shot
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.precision_shot.desc=A fully drawn bow shot deals double damage.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herbalist=Herbalist
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herbalist.desc=Always harvest one extra from magic-mod plants.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.gathering_efficiency=Gathering Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.gathering_efficiency.desc=Forage breaks cost 1 less stamina. Does not affect mining, shearing, or fishing.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.bountiful_harvest=Bountiful Harvest
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.bountiful_harvest.desc=Mature food crops always drop one extra. Not melons, pumpkins, or magic-mod herbs.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.rancher=Rancher
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.rancher.desc=Tended animals nearby grow, breed, drink, and produce faster. Milk still costs a bucket.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.drafter=Drafter
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.drafter.desc=Unlocks Effortless Building lines, walls, floors, and diagonals.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sculptor=Sculptor
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sculptor.desc=Unlocks Effortless Building circles, cylinders, spheres, and cubes.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.transpose=Transpose
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.transpose.desc=Unlocks Effortless Building quick replace.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.vis_thrift=Vis Thrift
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.vis_thrift.desc=Foci and the Arcane Workbench spend 30% less vis.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.quiet_mind=Quiet Mind
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.quiet_mind.desc=Warp incidents are milder. Some fail to take hold at all.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.glass_cutter=Glass Cutter
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.glass_cutter.desc=Breaking glass and panes drops the block instead of shards of nothing.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herd_abundance=Herd Abundance
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herd_abundance.desc=Shearing Animania sheep or goats yields extra breed wool. Empty-hand nest collection yields an extra egg.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.iron_gut=Iron Gut
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.iron_gut.desc=Pack alcohols no longer apply their over-drink effect. Thirst and quality still apply.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.water_collector=Water Collector
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.water_collector.desc=Bottles and canteens filled from world water are purified. Drinking from a source skips Thirsty and parasites.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.full_font=Full Font
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.full_font.desc=Casting a focus from a nearly full aura costs more vis and empowers the next spell.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.blood_pact=Blood Pact
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.blood_pact.desc=Lose four hearts. Classified magic you deal is doubled.
